# Extra glslc flags for this repo's shaders. Read by cbuild --vulkan
# (/home/coopa/.sww/packages/cbuild/cbuild). One token per line.
#
# Paths are RELATIVE to the repo root -- cbuild invokes glslc with cwd=repo root.
# The CMake build doesn't read this file: gfx_add_shader_target()
# (gfxcoopa/cmake/GfxShaders.cmake) passes the same two directories itself.
#
# ORDER MATTERS and matches gfx_add_shader_target(): this repo's own shader dir
# first, then gfxcoopa's base library (shared gfx/ headers such as brdf.glsl,
# ibl.glsl, sky.glsl). glslc searches -I in order.
-I
assets/shaders
-I
libs/gfxcoopa/assets/shaders
